# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Lumen OS on the XGIMI Play 6: the Google add-on (docs/play6/OTA_GMS_PLAN.md 3, owner decision D4). Google's
# files live in their own logical partition lumen_gapps next to system in super, never in the system image, so
# a Lumen update (system only) keeps them. Without that partition this does nothing (sys.lumen.gapps=none).
# Before the package scan: overlay mounts at post-fs-data, the same moment as play6_compat.rc's bind mounts.
on post-fs-data
    exec_start lumen_gapps

service lumen_gapps /system/bin/sh /system/etc/xgimi/lumen_gapps.sh
    user root
    group root
    seclabel u:r:su:s0
    oneshot
    disabled
